{"unit_id":"regrevia__dsh-vantage#card-zh","repo":"regrevia/dsh-vantage","commit":"82182fd2cfd9c0df785c96be6738a45f24025454","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vantage（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在会话旁提供只读任务概览，帮助查看当前轮次做了什么、哪些事实和检查状态已记录。它把会话事件整理成进展摘要与历史记录，并在对话视图中加入概览页。主要功能包括当前轮次状态和待办概览、已完成轮次浏览、证据查看、摘要生成以及针对轮次的侧边提问。适合希望快速回顾 DSH 会话进度和已答复任务的人。使用前需要兼容版本的 DSH；模型摘要使用会话默认模型，也可选配指定 provider 和 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:137","index.js:1187","client.js:2079","lib/api.js:80","lib/store.js:91"]}
{"unit_id":"regrevia__dsh-vantage#card-en","repo":"regrevia/dsh-vantage","commit":"82182fd2cfd9c0df785c96be6738a45f24025454","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vantage (DSH Web plugin) adds a read-only overview beside a conversation. It summarizes current round progress, status and evidence, and keeps bounded history. Users can browse completed rounds and ask questions about them. It requires compatible DSH; summaries use the session model.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:137","index.js:1187","client.js:2079","lib/api.js:80","lib/store.js:91"]}
